  "_pins": [
    "A full freeze of a known-good resolution, applied as the last image layer",
    "so a rebuild installs what was tested. Applying it last also overrides the",
    "Modal image builder: version 2023.12 appends `pip install -r",
    "/modal_requirements.txt` after this task's Dockerfile, which pins",
    "fastapi==0.88.0 and drags starlette down to 0.22.0, breaking every test",
    "that uses TestClient. Regenerate with `pip freeze` after changing the",
    "chess app's dependencies."
  ],
